<title>BELGIUM: French SocGen makes market in Petrofina options.</title>
<headline>French SocGen makes market in Petrofina options.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Paris became designated market maker in options on shares of Belgian oil group Petrofina, Belgian futures and options exchange Belfox said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SocGen Paris is already market maker in futures and options on the Belgian Bel-20 share index.</p>
<p>A designated market maker provides, for an option on a specific share, permanent buy and sell prices in all series pertaining to this option.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
